  "summary_plain": "Forty-six printed bars, each a full bar of six eighths in 6/8 with two flats. The upper staff opens in treble and the lower staff in bass; later systems only reprint those clefs, and no clef change is printed. There is no pickup, repeat, ending, or meter or key change. Systems 8 and 10 were checked on the print and agree with the proposed barlines. The last bar ends with a light-heavy final barline and fermatas, and its written values still fill one bar. Systems 1–7 and 9 were already verified on these pixels and are copied unchanged.",
